   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity 1. Establishment of infrastructure and operation plan for ultra-high density shrimp farms / Activity 2. Eco-friendly operation and localization of ultra-high density shrimp farms in Vietnam / Activity 3. Capacity enhancement and partnership building for Vietnamese aquaculture workers</narrative>
